//x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1769832954895774001\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-03-18T21:07:13Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>retweet</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1769833947821666324":{"a":"<p>I am who I am and no amount of money will change me. Money is not real. It&#x27;s just a mental tool which makes trading goods less complicated. Believing money is more than a tool is an extinction level event in the making. <a href=\"https://x.com/SubRosaMagick/status/1769831060286665136\">Tweet by @SubRosaMagick</a></p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/SubRosaMagick/status/1769831060286665136\">https://x.com/SubRosaMagick/status/1769831060286665136</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1769833947821666324</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1769833947821666324\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-03-18T21:11:09Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1769834313690878216":{"a":"<p>&quot;One cannot convince a human being to do something they would not already have done under different circumstances.&quot; -- My Past Masters</p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1769833947821666324\">https://x.com/i/status/1769833947821666324</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1769834313690878216</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1769834313690878216\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-03-18T21:12:36Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1769837167839228061":{"a":"<p>Next thing would be a floor heating/cooling system retrofit for homes that is super thin composite wood or stone with coolant loops inside fed from heat pumps. Rip out the carpet and vinyl floors and replace with a floor that is energy efficient and not prone to harboring mold.</p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1769824175999349200\">https://x.com/i/status/1769824175999349200</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1769837167839228061</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1769837167839228061\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-03-18T21:23:57Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1769837727845892336":{"a":"<p>Then an air filtration system which does not rely on throw-away filters. Do away with air ducts as much as possible and provide fresh air intake directly through the exterior walls and roof. No more mold killing children and elderly slowly. No more walking around sniffling.</p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1769837167839228061\">https://x.com/i/status/1769837167839228061</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1769837727845892336</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1769837727845892336\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-03-18T21:26:10Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1769838074907775291":{"a":"<p>Then we do lighting. Replace all the lighting in a home with properly tuned wavelengths which program your brain for the time of day. Mimicking the outdoor color temperature with the option to simulate the current cloud cover outdoors. Variable luminance to avoid eye fatigue.</p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1769837727845892336\">https://x.com/i/status/1769837727845892336</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1769838074907775291</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1769838074907775291\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-03-18T21:27:33Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1769838476394922439":{"a":"<p>Do all this and focus on making these products super cheap to insurance restoration contractors and free for homes with children. Make the technology available to other manufacturers on reasonable/free terms to boost adoption. Lobby for government standards to force manufacturers</p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1769838074907775291\">https://x.com/i/status/1769838074907775291</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1769838476394922439</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1769838476394922439\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-03-18T21:29:09Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1769839158703333758":{"a":"<p>So much more to do. Especially with regard to growing essential nutrients in the home like mushrooms and herbs and fruit. Ripping out the moldy walls and replacing with waterproof wall boards and hydrophobic insulation. I saw too many deadly homes as IT director at DKI; Largest…</p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1769838476394922439\">https://x.com/i/status/1769838476394922439</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1769839158703333758</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1769839158703333758\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-03-18T21:31:52Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1769840047954530386":{"a":"<p>Mood: If you can have a computer inside a $3000 fridge I think you can afford a $300 ice maker that doesn&#x27;t poison your kids.</p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a hre